# Homework 1 - Cardiovascular Disease Classification

This assignment uses the `cardio_train.csv` dataset to predict the presence or absence of cardiovascular disease.

## Objectives
- Preprocess the cardiovascular disease dataset
- Split the data into 70% training and 30% testing sets
- Train and compare:
  - Logistic Regression
  - Random Forest Classifier
  - Decision Tree Classifier
- Standardize the data for Logistic Regression
- Identify the best-performing model
- Report and visualize the most important features
- Display the confusion matrix for the best-performing model
- Determine the optimal depth for the Decision Tree Classifier
- Evaluate whether tuning the tree depth improves performance

## Files
- Jupyter Notebook containing the analysis and model evaluation
- `cardio_train.csv` dataset
